/* Alias the existing FGDC table for symmetry. Renaming the old constant
   would touch ~30 sites — instead we keep `LITH` as the FGDC table
   (its historical identity) and expose `LITH_FGDC` as a clear alias.
   Callers that want "whichever standard is active" use
   activeLithCatalogue() defined below. */
const LITH_FGDC = LITH;

