<p><strong>Precambrian — FGDC · CGMW · VSEGEI.</strong> FGDC and CGMW use
the modern ICS geon scheme (Neo-/Meso-/Paleo-proterozoic,
Neo-/Meso-/Paleo-/Eo-archean); FGDC defines no Precambrian stages. VSEGEI
retains the Russian Riphean–Vendian / Karelian–Lopian framework.</p>
